  "question": {
    "text": "The point at which the line segment joining <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> subtends an obtuse angle is",
